@startuml
!include style.iuml
title AD-9: Certificate Verification (WF-21)
|User|
start
:Open verification page;
:Enter certificate ID;
|System|
:Look up certificate ID;
if (Certificate found?) then (yes)
  :Display validity status;
  :Display student name, project title,\ncompletion date and certificate ID;
else (no)
  :Display that no valid certificate exists;
endif
:Record verification attempt;
note right
  No access to the private
  project workspace is required.
end note
stop
@enduml
